  "description": "DEZKID crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P 42/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C208 H282 O58 Tb9 1+,N1 O3 1-. From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb5 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2C (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb3C (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb4C (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb5C (Tb) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 20 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.602-5.160 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 88.41-167.88°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Tb9(Hesa)16(μ-OH)10(NO3). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula). Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
